# Desktop UX

Follow `docs/engineering/desktop-ux.md` and ADR-0014.

- Editor kinds: `profile`, `proxy`, `helpers`. One window each. Native frame. No Frameless.
- Footer button order: Windows Save then Cancel; macOS/Linux Cancel then Save.
- Enter saves, Esc cancels, Cmd/Ctrl+W closes. Dirty close asks "Discard changes?".
- Save disabled when name blank, form clean, or save in flight.
- Destructive confirm defaults to Cancel.
- Body scrolls; title and footer stay. Semantic colors; no white BackgroundColour override.
- Helper groups come from Go. MUST NOT re-group by bundle id in TypeScript.
- MUST NOT encode Proxy/Direct/Block rules in TypeScript.
- MUST NOT add undo, toasts, saved layouts, or password reveal in this epic.
- UI language is English.
